  "source_hypothesis": "Scalar properly supported classical P of any real order on a smooth Hausdorff second-countable manifold with a positive smooth density; the complex bracket is nonzero on the entire characteristic set. Conclusions are modulo proper smooth kernels, in the explicit proper pseudolocal class; no global noncompact L2 assertion is made.",
